<title>INDIA: India TELCO sees 10-12 pct sales growth.</title>
<headline>India TELCO sees 10-12 pct sales growth.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian truck-maker Tata Engineering and Locomotive Company Ltd (TELCO) chairman Ratan Tata said on Wednesday he expected a 10-12 percent growth in sales during 1997/98 (April-March).</p>
<p>Tata was addressing shareholders at the firm's annual general meeting in Bombay.  </p>
<p>Sales in the first quarter ending June 30 were down more than 10 percent with exports falling 38 percent, but construction equipment business grew 35 percent, he said.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
